cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the cultural concepts dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Thaqafa-RepE: Representation Engineering for Arab Cultural Concepts in Large Language Models"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Thaqafa-RepE Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/al3obdi/Thaqafa-RepE"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - representation-engineering
  - interpretability
  - cultural-alignment
  - arabic
  - nlp
abstract: >-
  A reproducible toolkit for studying whether Arab cultural concepts are
  linearly represented inside open-weight language models, and whether those
  representations can be steered: a bilingual concept dataset, contrastive
  mean-difference vector extraction, hook-based steering with a scoped
  context manager, and an evaluation protocol reporting steering effect
  against fluency cost.
